WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.734
New this morning,

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.835
the Russian capital

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.037
getting a firsthand sense of war

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.905
after an alleged drone attack.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.274
You see a plume of smoke rising.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:09.342
And take a look at this.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.777
You can actually see a drone

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.245
flying over the city

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.314
as a man points out of his window.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:14.981
And here,

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:16.816
what appears to be a fragment

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.151
of a downed drone.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:18.785
Russian state

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:19.652
media says two

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.087
people were injured in Moscow

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.455
and three residential buildings

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.057
were damaged in the attack.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:25.191
Russian military officials

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.060
blame Ukraine for this,

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.095
something, of course, Ukraine denies

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:29.662
the attack.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.031
Though, coming just hours after yet

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.932
another aerial assault on Kiev.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:33.800
Ukrainian officials

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.168
say one woman was killed.

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.370
13 people hurt.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.339
There have been 17 attacks on Kiev.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:39.873
So far

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.607
just this month

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.641
ahead of that planned

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.176
counteroffensive we've been talking

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.210
so much about.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.812
Officials also just releasing

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.379
this body

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.480
camera video of police

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.916
responding to one of those attacks.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.451
It gives you a real time

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.887
look at the daily reality of war here

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.055
as officers are out there

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.356
to help injured civilians.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:56.823
Let's bring in now

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:57.290
CNN's Fred

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.591
Pleitgen, who's live in eastern

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.293
Ukraine for us this morning.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:00.860
So first, Fred,

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:01.628
what more are we hearing

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:03.263
about this attack on Moscow?

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:06.733
Hi there, Poppy.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:07.534
Well, certainly

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.002
the Russians are pretty shaken

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:09.602
by this attack

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.604
that happened there on Moscow.

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.272
And one of the things

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.073
that they're obviously doing,

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:13.706
as you've noticed,

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.408
is they blamed, as they put it, the Kiev

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.310
regime obviously blaming the Ukrainian.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.378
Some of that footage

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:20.246
that came out of Russia

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.648
certainly seemed to be pretty dramatic

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.817
with that person pointing at that drone.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.486
Now, the Russians say that all of a UAV,

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.487
as they put it, the drones

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.288
that were sent towards

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:30.590
Moscow were put out of commission.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.258
They say that several were taken down

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.960
using electronic countermeasures

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.994
which brought them off course

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.029
and then they crashed.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.597
But they also say that in five cases,

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:38.731
they needed to activate

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:39.732
their air defenses

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.668
and shoot them down with short range

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:42.902
air defense systems.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.271
All the punchier air defense system.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.272
Nevertheless,

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.073
there have been several

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:47.874
Russian politicians

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:48.808
who have come out and said, look,

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:51.411
we believe this could be our new reality.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.412
This could be the case

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.013
because of the ongoing war

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:54.681
in Ukraine,

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.883
that it can also come to Moscow.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:57.450
But obviously,

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.952
a lot of residents in that city

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.120
pretty shaken as well.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.654
This happened in the early morning

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.522
hours of today

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.057
and definitely not something

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.725
the Russians have seen before

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.260
as this civil war has been going on.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:07.560
Guys,

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:10.563
Can you tell us

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.531
more about the strikes

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.367
overnight in Kiev, Fred?

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.568
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.603
I'm actually at the scene

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.304
of one of the strikes here

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.572
that happened in Kiev. Overnight.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.140
And I can tell you,

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.441
we were actually in Kiev.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:23.343
We're not in eastern Ukraine.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.912
And the night was definitely not calm.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:27.647
I mean, it was over several hours

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.082
that we heard drones in the air

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:29.916
the entire time.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.651
And those Iranian made shadow drones

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.519
where you can see

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:34.587
hear the engine howling the entire time.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:36.389
And then you could also hear

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:37.891
the sound of the machine

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:38.992
gunfire as the Ukrainians

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.093
were trying to take them down.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:40.960
Where we are right now,

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.595
you can see substantial damage

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.597
after one of these drones impacted here.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:44.998
You can see

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.733
the cleanup is already going on.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.101
And I want to just ask our

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:49.135
our cameraman will Biden

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:50.270
and he's going to pan up right now.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.237
And you can see that

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:51.638
it actually

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:53.907
impacted up there in the first in the top

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:55.742
couple of floors of that building.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:56.576
Now, that is something

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.411
that is absolutely significant, guys.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.046
Because despite the fact

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.447
that the Russians shot

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.082
dozens of drones once again

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:05.118
or sent them at the capital, Kiev,

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:06.252
the Ukrainians say

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.154
they managed to take most of the drones

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:08.955
down now.

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:10.590
What you're seeing up there,

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.691
the Ukrainians are seeing

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:12.859
is actually damage

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.161
from a drone that was down and debris

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:16.663
then hit this building

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:17.730
and caused that explosion

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.431
that you saw up there,

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:19.832
unfortunately, in this building.

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:21.000
One woman was killed.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.135
I was able to speak to Kiev's

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:23.303
mayor about this right here

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:23.970
a couple of minutes ago.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.571
Here's what he said.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:28.875
Actually, may we have

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:33.179
a lot of attacks to our cities,

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:35.682
not just to the capital of Ukraine.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:36.950
Also in another city.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:39.719
And a lot of people killed

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:42.822
Kiev Mayor Vitaly

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:43.590
Klitschko, of course,

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.924
former boxing champ as well.

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.759
He was on the scene here very early on.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:47.527
And, of course,

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.562
not a quiet night here at all.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.129
And, you know,

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:52.098
this is the third major

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.433
missile and drone attack

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.068
that we've had here in the city

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:55.902
in the past, I'd say.

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.203
30 to 36 hours,

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:57.704
some of them with

00:03:57.704 --> 00:03:58.871
drones and cruise missiles,

00:03:58.871 --> 00:03:59.272
some of them

00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:00.340
also with ballistic missiles.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.174
So right now,

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:02.075
Ukrainian capital

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:03.876
really feeling and a lot of people here

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:04.644
obviously showing

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:06.346
a lot of resilience, guys.

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:07.981
Fred Pleitgen live for us in Kiev,

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.649
thank you very much.

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:09.849
Well,

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:11.451
all of this comes as President Lenski

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:13.052
now says he's made a decision

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:13.920
on the timing

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.521
of Ukraine's counteroffensive

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.993
the Italian austerity,

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:21.127
the commander in chief

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:21.995
and the commanders

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:23.596
of the operational directions

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.098
reported to the south,

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:27.166
not only the supply of ammunition

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.535
not only the training of new brigades,

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:32.105
not only our tactics, not tactics,

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.140
but also the timing.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.342
This is what is most important.

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.444
The timing of how we will move forward.

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.013
We will.

00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:42.782
The decisions have been made.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.484
Joining us now, CNN military analyst,

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:45.451
former member of the Joint

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.020
Chief of the Joint Staff of the Pentagon.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.588
Retired Colonel Cedric Leighton. Colonel.

00:04:48.588 --> 00:04:49.389
Always good to see you.

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:51.190
As we listen to what we heard

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.358
from President Zelensky

00:04:52.358 --> 00:04:53.960
in that nightly address,

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.061
the fact that he says

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:56.195
they now have the timing,

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.263
not saying what that timing is

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.998
for obvious reasons,

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:01.434
but that the timing has been decided.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.635
What does that signal to you

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:03.736
in terms of where things

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:04.904
stand for this counteroffensive?

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:06.873
How quickly could it happen?

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:07.874
Well, good morning, Eric.

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:10.343
It really tells me that they've

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:11.611
finalized their plans.

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:12.879
They're moving forward in a way

00:05:12.879 --> 00:05:15.348
that is quite methodical

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.183
and they're doing it in a way

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:19.118
that will allow them to

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:20.920
move forces where they need to.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.622
Now, the one thing that they don't have

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:24.557
is strategic surprise,

00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:26.859
but they do have tactical surprise.

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:29.062
They can move forces where they need to.

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:29.495
The Russians,

00:05:29.495 --> 00:05:30.863
of course, are going to be watching them

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:32.865
from an intelligence perspective.

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:34.967
But they will be able to do some things

00:05:34.967 --> 00:05:36.869
that will keep the Russians guessing.

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:38.338
But there's clearly a timetable

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.272
that's been set.

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:41.274
And we should be seeing a few things,

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:43.042
maybe not like D-Day back in World

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:43.443
War Two,

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.811
but we will be seeing a few things

00:05:44.811 --> 00:05:45.912
that indicate an offensive

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.347
is going forward.

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:47.947
I'm interested

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:48.481
in why

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:51.017
Zelensky would have said that, that

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.618
we have decided on a timeframe

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:53.786
we have one.

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:54.887
Why would he say that at all?

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:56.322
Why would he make that pronouncement?

00:05:57.357 --> 00:05:59.225
Poppy, I think it's it's messaging.

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:00.893
I think it's also psychological.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:01.961
And what he's trying to do

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:04.497
is he's trying to tell the Russian side

00:06:04.964 --> 00:06:05.565
that to

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:06.733
we are coming for you,

00:06:06.733 --> 00:06:07.900
we are going to

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.002
move you out of our country.

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.671
But on the other hand, he's

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:12.839
still keeping them guessing,

00:06:12.839 --> 00:06:13.639
although he's made some

00:06:13.639 --> 00:06:15.541
pretty emphatic statements here.

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:16.142
He's keeping them

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:18.544
guessing as to the timing and the place

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.146
where this is actually going to occur.

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:22.215
And it could even be places

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:23.516
in the sense that he could use

00:06:23.516 --> 00:06:25.017
multiple areas

00:06:25.017 --> 00:06:27.453
to mount certain types of attacks.

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:30.323
We've seen this litany of attacks in key.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:32.825
But we are also seeing attacks

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:33.659
making the way

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:34.527
all the way to Moscow

00:06:34.527 --> 00:06:36.229
Russian officials as Fred Pleitgen gets.

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:37.130
Fred Pleitgen,

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:37.597
excuse me,

00:06:37.597 --> 00:06:38.297
just said,

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:38.564
saying

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:38.898
they believe

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.534
this could be their new reality.

00:06:42.135 --> 00:06:44.237
How are you reading that this morning?

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:46.205
How are you reading those attacks?

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:47.840
Yeah, these are very interesting

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.541
because generally

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.042
what they're using are drones

00:06:50.042 --> 00:06:51.944
that are actually Soviet era drones

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:53.012
that have been modified

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.614
by the Ukrainians.

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:57.250
So the Ukrainians are not violating

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.050
any promises

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.087
that they've made to the West

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:02.021
and to the U.S.

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:03.956
in particular, not to use U.S.

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:05.358
or Western supplied weapons

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:07.126
to attack Russia itself.

00:07:07.126 --> 00:07:08.194
But they're still doing it.

00:07:08.194 --> 00:07:09.595
And it's not quite,

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:10.997
you know, setting Russia ablaze,

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.665
to borrow a phrase from Churchill.

00:07:12.665 --> 00:07:13.933
But what they are doing is

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:15.768
they are actually moving forward

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:18.204
and telling the Russian population

00:07:18.337 --> 00:07:19.772
that they are at risk

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:21.340
of some kind of an attack.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.308
It's not

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:23.042
as bad

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:24.177
or as severe

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:26.446
as the attacks on Kiev, obviously,

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:27.713
but it is clearly something

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:29.015
that puts people at risk.

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:31.184
And it's a warning.

00:07:31.184 --> 00:07:32.418
One question and all of this

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:33.753
sort of bigger picture

00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:35.822
Colonel, is the role of China

00:07:35.822 --> 00:07:36.522
and can China

00:07:36.522 --> 00:07:38.024
be a moderating force at all?

00:07:38.024 --> 00:07:39.058
They have said as much,

00:07:39.058 --> 00:07:40.393
but there are real questions

00:07:40.393 --> 00:07:42.061
about what that would look like

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:43.629
and where their alliance would be.

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:45.364
The fact that given that the

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:47.900
Chinese government is

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.202
refusing to sit down

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:49.969
with Defense

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:51.471
Secretary Lloyd Austin,

00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:52.772
basically saying, no,

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:54.707
you cannot meet with your counterpart

00:07:54.707 --> 00:07:56.142
at this security forum

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:57.109
happening this week

00:07:57.109 --> 00:07:57.777
in Singapore,

00:07:57.777 --> 00:07:59.245
reminds me of what Lloyd Austin

00:07:59.245 --> 00:07:59.879
told Caitlyn

00:07:59.879 --> 00:08:01.581
in their interview months ago

00:08:01.581 --> 00:08:03.649
after the spy balloon right that

00:08:03.649 --> 00:08:04.784
basically the Chinese weren't

00:08:04.784 --> 00:08:06.252
picking up the phone.

00:08:06.252 --> 00:08:07.286
It does not seem like

00:08:07.286 --> 00:08:09.121
things have improved since then.

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:10.356
How does that factor into

00:08:10.356 --> 00:08:12.925
what's going on in Russia and Ukraine?

00:08:12.925 --> 00:08:14.126
Yeah, that's certainly true.

00:08:14.126 --> 00:08:15.361
Things have not improved.

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:16.696
And it seems as if China

00:08:16.696 --> 00:08:19.165
and Russia are basically in lockstep

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:19.765
when it comes

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:21.834
to the diplomatic aspect of this.

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:23.035
And I think what

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:24.337
the Chinese are failing to do

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:25.738
in this particular case

00:08:25.738 --> 00:08:27.874
is take advantage of an opportunity

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.609
to play the role of mediator

00:08:29.609 --> 00:08:30.810
or at least seem to be playing

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.178
the role of mediator.

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:33.513
The very fact that they're not meeting

00:08:33.513 --> 00:08:34.213
with Secretary

00:08:34.213 --> 00:08:35.781
Austin is an indication

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:37.917
that they are not really interested

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:38.951
in being a mediator.

00:08:38.951 --> 00:08:39.752
They're more interested

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:40.820
in supporting Putin.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:41.854
And that's going to limit

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.623
their effectiveness with Ukraine,

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:44.257
and it's going to limit

00:08:44.257 --> 00:08:45.057
their effectiveness

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:47.126
with other countries in the West.

00:08:47.126 --> 00:08:47.727
Colonel Cedric

00:08:47.727 --> 00:08:49.128
Leighton, always appreciate your insight.

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:49.629
Thank you.

